      {
        "text": "Epic Schematic armors unlock unique passives. Classes rated 'Epic-Schem' drop 1–2 tiers if unequipped.",
        "attribution": "Amya",
        "source": "knowledge/vets-and-docs/amya-hero-tierlist.md"
      },
      {
        "text": "Left to right order matters.",
