      },
      {
        "text": "AA-tier class have their own special job, A-tier could be considered AA-tier or even S-tier by some but imo they are just a weaker version for the same job ... Bastard is by far the most OP weapon but does require to know 'the tech' to make it's value sky-rocket.",
